# es-v10-72: 3 s holds at throttle 1, with 0.5 s sweeps between them.
hold 900 1 3
sweep 900 2000 1 0.5
hold 2000 1 3
sweep 2000 3000 1 0.5
hold 3000 1 3
sweep 3000 4000 1 0.5
hold 4000 1 3
sweep 4000 5000 1 0.5
hold 5000 1 3
sweep 5000 6000 1 0.5
hold 6000 1 3
sweep 6000 7000 1 0.5
hold 7000 1 3
sweep 7000 8000 1 0.5
hold 8000 1 3
sweep 8000 9000 1 0.5
hold 9000 1 3
